---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Praweg Koirala"
  description="Career, skills, and certifications of Praweg Koirala."
>
  <section>
    <h1 class="mb-2 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em]">About Me</h1>

    <div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-lg leading-[1.7] text-muted">
      <p>
        I'm Praweg Koirala, a software engineer and entrepreneur based in
        Fort Collins, Colorado. I build AI-powered products on the cloud.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work spans biomedical engineering, construction tech, and AI
        product development.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="my-16">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-[2rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em]">Career</h2>
      <div class="relative pl-8 before:absolute before:inset-y-0 before:left-0 before:w-0.5 before:bg-line before:content-['']">
        <div class="relative mb-8 before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] before:top-[1.2rem] before:h-3 before:w-3 before:-translate-x-1/2 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent before:content-['']">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">PkoLabs LLC</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">2024 — Present</span>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
            Founder. Building AI-powered products and cloud-native
            solutions.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative mb-8 before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] before:top-[1.2rem] before:h-3 before:w-3 before:-translate-x-1/2 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent before:content-['']">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">KDuo Production — Co-founder</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">2012 — 2023</span>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
            Co-founded a production house in Nepal. Leading technology
            strategy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative mb-8 before:absolute before:left-[-2rem] before:top-[1.2rem] before:h-3 before:w-3 before:-translate-x-1/2 before:rounded-full before:bg-accent before:content-['']">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">ARUP Laboratories</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">2012 — 2020</span>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Medical technologist at a Genomics laboratory.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="my-16">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-[2rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em]">Skills & Expertise</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Python</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Dart / Flutter</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">NextJS</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">NodeJS</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Astro</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Node.js</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">AWS Cloud</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Terraform</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Docker</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">CI/CD</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">AI / Agentic Pipelines</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">ComfyUI</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Gemini / ADK</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">MySQL</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Git / GitHub Actions</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">MongoDB</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">React</span>
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/15 bg-accent/8 px-3.5 py-1 text-sm text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Vercel / CloudFront</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="my-16">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-[2rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em]">Certifications</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr))] gap-8">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">AWS Solutions Architect — Associate</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">July 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">AWS Cloud Practitioner</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">July 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-line bg-card p-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">HuggingFace AI Agents</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">2025</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="my-16">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-[2rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em]">Currently Building</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Kids Story Generator</strong> — Agentic AI pipeline using Python/ADK/Gemini
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>LIFU Kids Application</strong> — An Interactive educational
          platform for children | Multiplatform - iOS, Android & Web. | Flutter-mobile,
          TypeScript-web
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Trading bots</strong> — Automated BullPut spread trading on
          Alpaca with XSP/SPY options. | Python, Hermes Agent, Open Router(LLM),
          Docker(VPS)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Industrial Meter management system </strong> — Multi-tiered
          architecture utilizing Modbus protocol with real-time data acquisition
          and monitoring capabilities.| Python, Modbus, PostgreSQL, Docker,React.js,
          AWS.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>ComfyUI GCP Storage Decouple</strong> — Custom ComfyUI node
          for cloud storage. | Python, ComfyUI, GCP.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>prawegko.dev</strong> — This Astro portfolio on S3/CloudFront.
          | Astro, AWS-S3, AWS-CloudFront, Github Actions
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
